## Current State (End-to-End Pipeline)

```
User Request → POST /v1/sessions/{id}/turn
    → process_turn()
        → Build runtime with system_prompt (or retry_system_prompt on retry)
        → run_turn_headless() (with bounded tool loop, max 8 iterations)
        → extract_mql5_code() (3-phase, strict fallback)
        → compile_mql5_async() → compile-service.py → metaeditor64.exe
        → If compile fails → build_compile_feedback() → retry with retry_system_prompt()
        → If compile succeeds → save_strategy_async() → database
        → broadcast events (SSE) to frontend
        → Return task result
```

